{
    "title": "Solitaire Daily: Card Game",
    "description": "Welcome to Solitaire Daily: Card Game, where strategy meets relaxation in this timeless classic card game right on your device. Whether you're a classic solitaire enthusiast or new to the classic solitaire game, Solitaire Daily offers a smooth, engaging experience that has captivated players for centuries.\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n\u2660 To solve the Solitaire deal, you need to tap, drag or drop to sort cards of 4 suits in ascending order, Ace, 2, ... Jack, Queen, King.\r\n\u2665 You will have 7 card column options where you can move one card or consecutive cards from one column to another.\r\n\u2660 King or any consecutive cards starting with K can be moved to the empty columns.\r\n\u2665 Click the card stock and find the card you want if you get stuck.\r\n \r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2665 Classic Gameplay: Experience the traditional Solitaire gameplay with options for both the popular 1-card and challenging 3-card draw modes.\r\n\u2660 Customizable Themes: Personalize your solitaire game with a variety of beautiful card backs to make your game truly yours.\r\n\u2665 Mind-Bending Challenges: Engage with hundreds of unique challenges that will test your skills and keep you entertained for hours.\r\n\u2660 Smart Hints & Undos: Stuck on a move? Use unlimited hints and undos to find your way through the challenge and help you become a solitaire master.\r\n\u2665 Daily Challenges: Start your day with a unique Solitaire game puzzle. Complete daily challenges and improve your concentration, patience, and strategic thinking.\r\n\u2660 Statistics Tracker: Track your progress with detailed statistics, including win rates and the fastest solitaire game completion times.\r\n\u2665 User-Friendly Interface: Experience a clean, intuitive interface that makes solitaire games smooth and enjoyable for everyone of all ages.\r\n \r\nWhy Choose Solitaire Daily?\r\nSolitaire Daily offers more than just card games. It's a moment of peace in your busy day. Perfect for unwinding, stimulating your brain, or simply enjoying a moment of solitude, this app brings a mindful approach to the classic card game. Whether you're killing time on a lazy afternoon or sharpening your mind, Solitaire Master is the perfect companion. And it's totally free!\r\nAccessible to Everyone:\r\nWhether you're a seasoned Solitaire master or new to the solitaire card games, Solitaire Daily's intuitive gameplay and supportive features make it easy to pick up and impossible to put down.\r\n\r\nIf you like playing Classic Solitaire, Spider Solitaire, Spades, Tripeaks Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, or any Patience Solitaire card game, then don't miss this free solitaire! Download the free solitaire card game available for your mobile device today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Solitaire Daily: Card Game, where strategy meets relaxation in this timeless classic card game right on your device. Whether you&#39;re a classic solitaire enthusiast or new to the classic solitaire game, Solitaire Daily offers a smooth, engaging experience that has captivated players for centuries.<br><br>How to play:<br>\u2660 To solve the Solitaire deal, you need to tap, drag or drop to sort cards of 4 suits in ascending order, Ace, 2, ... Jack, Queen, King.<br>\u2665 You will have 7 card column options where you can move one card or consecutive cards from one column to another.<br>\u2660 King or any consecutive cards starting with K can be moved to the empty columns.<br>\u2665 Click the card stock and find the card you want if you get stuck.<br> <br>Features:<br>\u2665 Classic Gameplay: Experience the traditional Solitaire gameplay with options for both the popular 1-card and challenging 3-card draw modes.<br>\u2660 Customizable Themes: Personalize your solitaire game with a variety of beautiful card backs to make your game truly yours.<br>\u2665 Mind-Bending Challenges: Engage with hundreds of unique challenges that will test your skills and keep you entertained for hours.<br>\u2660 Smart Hints &amp; Undos: Stuck on a move? Use unlimited hints and undos to find your way through the challenge and help you become a solitaire master.<br>\u2665 Daily Challenges: Start your day with a unique Solitaire game puzzle. Complete daily challenges and improve your concentration, patience, and strategic thinking.<br>\u2660 Statistics Tracker: Track your progress with detailed statistics, including win rates and the fastest solitaire game completion times.<br>\u2665 User-Friendly Interface: Experience a clean, intuitive interface that makes solitaire games smooth and enjoyable for everyone of all ages.<br> <br>Why Choose Solitaire Daily?<br>Solitaire Daily offers more than just card games. It&#39;s a moment of peace in your busy day. Perfect for unwinding, stimulating your brain, or simply enjoying a moment of solitude, this app brings a mindful approach to the classic card game. Whether you&#39;re killing time on a lazy afternoon or sharpening your mind, Solitaire Master is the perfect companion. And it&#39;s totally free!<br>Accessible to Everyone:<br>Whether you&#39;re a seasoned Solitaire master or new to the solitaire card games, Solitaire Daily&#39;s intuitive gameplay and supportive features make it easy to pick up and impossible to put down.<br><br>If you like playing Classic Solitaire, Spider Solitaire, Spades, Tripeaks Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, or any Patience Solitaire card game, then don&#39;t miss this free solitaire! Download the free solitaire card game available for your mobile device today!",
